    <string name="help_title">Cover screen setup</string>
    <string name="help_body">1. Open Settings › Cover screen › Widgets and add one or more \"Container N\" widgets.\n\n2. Configure the content of each container from this app.\n\n3. Enable \"Cover Widget Container overlay\" in Settings › Accessibility › Installed apps. If the switch is greyed out, open the app info › ⋮ › Allow restricted settings first.\n\nThe service is required: it draws your live, interactive widgets on top of each Container widget while the cover screen is unlocked. Without it a Container widget only shows its name.</string>
    <string name="help_open_settings">Open Settings</string>
